= The Healthcare Repeal Fight

Republicans in Congress are trying to repeal the Affordable Care Act, a bill that would take coverage away from millions. The vote in the Senate will be razor-thin.

- @repeal_mobilize: Mobilize patients and providers
- @repeal_negotiate: Negotiate behind the scenes

@repeal_mobilize
on-arrival: {!
Q.civic_strength += 300; Q.dem_enthusiasm = Math.min(10, Q.dem_enthusiasm + 1);
Q.uninsured -= 0.0;
if (Q.maga_strength < 60) { Q.uninsured += 0; }
Q.healthcare_agenda += 1; Q.working_dem += 2 * (1 - Q.dissent);
!}

Town halls overflow. The repeal effort collapses by a single vote.

@repeal_negotiate
on-arrival: gopmod_relation += 4; moderate_strength += 2; progressive_dissent += 3; uninsured += 0.5

We trade quietly with moderates. The bill is softened.
